  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\" data-listener-added_02335839=\"true\"><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-ZScPHERH\" id=\"h346b9f0-ZScPHERH\">一、应用程序介绍</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-R9UTFuA0\">创建的应用程序是指基于Marketing API开发的应用，如管理营销的投放平台、数据分析工具、DMP人群自动化管理等，非开始投放时需要投放的应用程序。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-V9Agsri3\"><br/></p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-QbYeifmU\" id=\"h490b8bf-QbYeifmU\">1.1 应用程序类型</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-7yIqiLrq\">应用根据业务场景分为【巨量营销】和【巨量千川】，不同业务场景对应接入能力范围不同，每个业务场景下最多可创建10个应用。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Gxhg8n1L\">【巨量营销】：巨量营销PC版（包含巨量星图、企业号）、DOU+</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-OWfAgrRx\">【巨量千川】：千川PC版、千川随心推</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t75ae23f-5kYBmP83\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-BmQk9NbK\"><col data-id=\"ce0cdca6-EnHFdDZn\" span=\"1\" width=\"14.464692482915718%\"/><col data-id=\"cc2b005e-ZYZYkWEE\" span=\"1\" width=\"17.084282460136674%\"/><col data-id=\"cf9f6a04-5ZmOVX0e\" span=\"1\" width=\"20.045558086560362%\"/><col data-id=\"cd9c0038-2OcaADJa\" span=\"1\" width=\"48.405466970387245%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-XBimEXUH\"><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-fFWdZTgU\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-M5FLa4NT\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-aE1LDwUL\">类型</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-5GWnkAJY\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ELqq4Plo\">应用场景</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-g3FMPtEU\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wLg303BQ\">客户类型/产品形态</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-nPm2EXX1\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-iA9UCFKZ\">应用权限范围</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-lXTrgAS1\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t07b4a2c-HeD2GHXS\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qCHojvIb\">基础应用</p></td><td data-id=\"ta5a4540-0bKjJWSE\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"2\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Gl6c7Y33\">自研投放系统</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-b3lSjnxY\"><br/></p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-YAEq9rRQ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-KeZLvybr\">客户</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-iZVA19YC\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Ga0X4cBL\">除【代理商账号管理】类接口</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-oI1fVb8U\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-MtcoJuQV\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-cSkRevGU\">代理商客户</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-NRfI7hd6\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-RNTxg2u3\">除【巨量引擎工作台管理】类接口</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-lieZDpe1\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"te4468fe-fk2D4YgH\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"2\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wr1DObfk\">提供第三方服务</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-LouRRCOC\"><br/></p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-J8Acfogd\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6sK2o9Ba\">独立三方站点</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"tba51aaf-3XnHNPj2\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"2\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-F1chlC8y\"><br/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-tRlnnnDl\">除【客户信息与资质管理（除\"客户公开信息\"接口）】、【代理商账号管理-创建和修改客户】、【代理商账号管理-资金和流水管理】类接口</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-KfFVBhSJ\"><br/></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-DiK9P3bg\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t1c8f800-AR5UJHTe\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6HuI35lQ\">服务市场应用</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t1c8f800-gNkjMmlb\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-iLIo4iCh\">群峰上架服务</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-sw5DGllw\"><br/></p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-3XUP6CYJ\" id=\"h490b8bf-3XUP6CYJ\">1.2 应用程序权限</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-EdCjybeM\">创建或编辑应用时可根据页面提示申请应用类型下可操作接口权限范围。</p><ol data-id=\"o23eaf9c-hTVcfYH0\" start=\"1\" style=\"list-style-position: inside;\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-XLhwGDpu\">应用拥有接口权限是可以向业务账户申请对应能力授权的前置条件。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-7BPdKvCb\">应用新增权限点后，需要重新向客户申请对应能力授权。</li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-bPfnyU9p\"><br/></p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-bAQTSkP3\" id=\"h490b8bf-bAQTSkP3\">1.3 应用回调地址</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-r6JtMwHs\">回调地址是一个用户自定义的链接地址，每一个应用都需要设置一个回调地址，开发者使用对应应用向业务账户申请授权时，授权同意后会将生成的授权码auth_code和授权链接设置的自定义参数state作为请求参数，访问跳转设置回调地址。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-TZXPcEDJ\">回调地址搭建案例可参考【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710504654860\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">回调地址怎么设置和使用</a>】</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-F0F7QMSp\"><br/></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-EHSQGA1j\" id=\"h346b9f0-EHSQGA1j\">二、申请创建应用程序</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-at3qtshI\">认证通过成为开发者后，可在开发者发者进入【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/developer/admin/ad_list\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">应用管理</a>】页面，创建业务场景所需应用程序</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-RmoylGvj\"><img data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/b9c43f118889407d860ca813a48f24e6~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2043900763&amp;x-signature=BOK3HZxkqgaz1F7ZN3fGIT80BWw%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\"/></p></div>",
  "doc_type": 1,
  "going_offline": false,
  "is_new": false,
  "path": null,
  "title": "如何创建应用程序\n"
}
